      "source" : "santa:authored-receiver-kind",
      "description" : "`sigmaProp(row 1 == control)` guards the box being SPENT. `Global.encodeNbits(BigInt 1)` with the receiver `Global` — the CONTROL. Evaluates to `16842752L` at cost 39. THE CONTROL: both sides of the EQ are the well-formed call, so the script reduces to true and the box SPENDS at cost 12109. It is what makes the six invalid rows about the receiver rather than about the shape of the carrier.",
